#heading(level: 1, numbering: none)[Epilogue]

This fictional study closes with the same practical lesson that applies to a
real dissertation: a thesis is both an argument and an artefact. Its research
must be defensible, but its structure must also let readers find, inspect, and
reuse the work.

The template does not prescribe a research story. It provides a dependable
place for one: from formal front matter through the main chapters, appendices,
and the personal material that records how the work came to be.
